<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Academic Grades & Assessment</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Master the complexity of academic reporting with a sophisticated results engine 
            specifically engineered for the ZIMSEC and primary school grading frameworks.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Continuous Assessment (CA) Workflow</h2>
        <p>
            Standardize your marking structures across all departments. Frame allows teachers 
            to define and record multiple Continuous Assessment (CA) marks—including 
            tests, projects, practicals, and assignments—directly into a digital mark-book. 
            The system automatically computes running totals and applies pre-configured 
            CA-to-Exam weightings, ensuring that final term grades are computed with 
            mathematical precision and complete consistency across the school.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integrated Head-of-Department (HOD) approval workflows ensure that results are 
            vetted for accuracy before being finalized and released to parents, 
            maintaining individual and organizational accountability.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">ZIMSEC-Aligned Grading & Ranking</h2>
        <p>
            Experience perfect alignment with the Zimbabwean educational standard. The 
            system natively supports ZIMSEC grading scales (A*, A, B, C, D, E, U) 
            while also allowing for custom school-specific grading tables. Automated 
            computation of class and subject standings (ranking) provides academic 
            leadership with immediate visibility of the school's "merit list," identifying 
            top academicians and those requiring additional learning support.
        </p>
        <p>
            Historical results are archived for the duration of the student's tenure, 
            providing a longitudinal view of progress across all academic forms and 
            subjects.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">High-fidelity Report Card Generation</h2>
        <p>
            Transform your results into a prestigious institutional presentation. Frame 
            automates the generation of branded, high-density PDF report cards, 
            incorporating termly grades, teacher comments, attendance summaries, and 
            extracurricular achievements. Performance graphs visualize the student's 
            progress over time compared to class averages, providing parents with 
            deep context and clarity during consultation events.
        </p>
        <p>
            Reports are delivered securely through the Parent Portal or WhatsApp chatbot, 
            significantly reducing the time and cost associated with traditionally 
            printed report cycles.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

